      "name": "memory_store.rs",
      "filePath": "src/memory_store.rs",
      "summary": "The central persistence facade for MemoryRecord storage, providing pluggable backends (file JSONL, encrypted JSONL, in-memory, RocksDB), write-ahead buffering, inverted indices for actor/action/target lookup, trust-weighted semantic search with cosine similarity, namespace filtering, audit log integration, snapshot/rollback, and recently patched archive exclusion from default search results.",
