      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "Uses IndexMap for ordered inverted indices and a VecDeque write-ahead buffer. The search_semantic method applies multi-factor ranking: cosine or keyword score x trust weight x priority multiplier x exponential time decay, with pinned records injected at the head."
